            ],
            "Select the display styles to position your share buttons.": [
                "Pasirinkite rodymo stilius, kad pozicionuotum\u0117te savo dalijimosi mygtukus."
            ],
            "Configure the appearance and behavior of your sidebar share buttons.": [
                "Konfig\u016bruokite savo \u0161onin\u0117s juostos dalijimosi mygtuk\u0173 i\u0161vaizd\u0105 ir elgsen\u0105."
            ],
            "Show only a set number of icons in the sidebar. Remaining icons open in a popup when visitors tap the + button.": [
                "Rodyti tik nustatyt\u0105 ikon\u0173 skai\u010di\u0173 \u0161onin\u0117je juostoje. Likusios ikonos atsidaro i\u0161kylan\u010diame lange, kai lankytojai paspaud\u017eia + mygtuk\u0105."
            ],
            "Add your X username to append via= to Twitter\/X share links from your buttons.": [
                "Prid\u0117kite savo X vartotojo vard\u0105, kad prid\u0117tum\u0117te via= prie Twitter\/X dalijimosi nuorod\u0173 i\u0161 savo mygtuk\u0173."
            ],
            "Twitter\/X @username": [
                "Twitter\/X @vartotojo_vardas"
            ],
            "Facebook App": [
                "Facebook programa"
            ],
            "How to create a Facebook app": [
                "Kaip sukurti Facebook program\u0105"
            ],
            "Facebook App ID": [
                "Facebook programos ID"
            ],
            "Required for Facebook share counts. Add your App ID and Secret from the Facebook developer portal.": [
                "B\u016btina Facebook dalijimosi skai\u010diams. Prid\u0117kite savo programos ID ir slapt\u0105 kod\u0105 i\u0161 Facebook k\u016br\u0117j\u0173 portalo."
            ],
            "Facebook App Secret": [
                "Facebook programos slaptas kodas"
            ],
            "Snapchat uses Snap Creative Kit Web so mobile visitors open the Snapchat app with your page link ready to share.": [
                "Snapchat naudoja Snap Creative Kit Web, tod\u0117l mobilieji lankytojai atidaro Snapchat program\u0105 su j\u016bs\u0173 puslapio nuoroda, paruo\u0161ta dalijimuisi."
            ],
            "Snap Kit Client ID (optional)": [
                "Snap Kit kliento ID (neprivaloma)"
            ],
            "Optional. Add your Snap Kit Client ID to attribute shares in the Snap Kit developer portal. Sharing works without it.": [
                "Nepaprasta. Prid\u0117kite savo Snap Kit kliento ID, kad priskirtum\u0117te dalijimus Snap Kit k\u016br\u0117j\u0173 portale. Dalijimasis veikia ir be jo."
            ],
            "How it works": [
                "Kaip tai veikia"
            ],
            "Add Snapchat from the Settings tab like any other button.": [
                "Prid\u0117kite Snapchat i\u0161 nustatym\u0173 skilties, kaip bet kur\u012f kit\u0105 mygtuk\u0105."
            ],
            "On mobile, tapping the button opens the Snapchat app share flow for the current page.": [
                "Mobiliajame telefone paspaudus mygtuk\u0105, atsidaro Snapchat programos dalijimosi srautas dabartiniam puslapiui."
            ],
            "On desktop, a Snapcode window opens so users can scan and share from their phone.": [
                "Darbalaukyje atsidaro Snapcode langas, kad naudotojai gal\u0117t\u0173 nuskaityti ir dalintis i\u0161 savo telefono."
            ],
            "Keep Open Graph tags enabled so Snapchat can show your page title and preview.": [
                "I\u0161laikykite Open Graph \u017eymes \u012fjungtas, kad Snapchat gal\u0117t\u0173 rodyti j\u016bs\u0173 puslapio pavadinim\u0105 ir per\u017ei\u016br\u0105."
            ],
            "Official Buttons": [
                "Oficial\u016bs mygtukai"
            ],
            "Choose a button style that fits your site's look and feel.": [
                "Pasirinkite mygtuko stili\u0173, kuris atitinka j\u016bs\u0173 svetain\u0117s i\u0161vaizd\u0105 ir poj\u016bt\u012f."
            ],
            "Dismiss this notice.": [
                "Atmesti \u0161\u012f prane\u0161im\u0105."
            ],
            "Dismiss": [
                "Atmesti"
            ],
            "Share on LinkedIn": [
                "Dalintis LinkedIn"
            ],
            "Simple Social Buttons Pro lets you set custom background, hover, and icon colors for every button, so they blend naturally with your website's design instead of standing out like a default plugin. Buttons that fit your site tend to get clicked more, which means more shares and more traffic for you. Pro also adds features like buttons on images, popups on exit intent, fly in slide animations, and more.": [
                "Simple Social Buttons Pro leid\u017eia nustatyti individualias fono, u\u017evedimo ir ikonos spalvas kiekvienam mygtukui, kad jie nat\u016braliai der\u0117t\u0173 su j\u016bs\u0173 svetain\u0117s dizainu, o ne i\u0161siskirt\u0173 kaip numatytasis papildinys. Mygtukai, kurie tinka j\u016bs\u0173 svetainei, da\u017eniau paspaud\u017eiami, o tai rei\u0161kia daugiau dalijimosi ir daugiau srauto jums. Pro taip pat prideda funkcijas, tokias kaip mygtukai ant vaizd\u0173, i\u0161\u0161okantys langai, kai ketinama i\u0161eiti, skaidr\u0117s animacijos ir kt."
            ],
            "Simple Social Buttons Pro lets you display share buttons directly on images and photos across your posts and pages, choose their position, add icon spacing, and set custom colors that match your site. You can also hide them on mobile and control exactly which post types they appear on. It's an easy way to turn every image into a shareable opportunity and drive more traffic.": [
                "Simple Social Buttons Pro leid\u017eia jums rodyti dalijimosi mygtukus tiesiogiai ant vaizd\u0173 ir nuotrauk\u0173 j\u016bs\u0173 \u012fra\u0161uose ir puslapiuose, pasirinkti j\u0173 pad\u0117t\u012f, prid\u0117ti ikonos tarpus ir nustatyti individualias spalvas, kurios atitinka j\u016bs\u0173 svetain\u0119. Taip pat galite juos pasl\u0117pti mobiliajame telefone ir tiksliai kontroliuoti, kuriuose \u012fra\u0161\u0173 tipuose jie pasirodo. Tai lengvas b\u016bdas paversti kiekvien\u0105 vaizd\u0105 dalijimosi galimybe ir pritraukti daugiau srauto."
            ],
            "Simple Social Buttons Pro lets you create a custom share popup with your own title and message, and trigger it exactly when it matters, like before visitors leave or after they scroll. You can add animation, display share counts or total shares to build social proof, and set custom colors to match your brand. It's a smart way to catch visitor attention right when they're most likely to share.": [
                "Simple Social Buttons Pro leid\u017eia jums sukurti individual\u0173 dalijimosi i\u0161\u0161okant\u012f lang\u0105 su savo pavadinimu ir \u017einute ir suaktyvinti j\u012f tiksliai tada, kai tai svarbu, pavyzd\u017eiui, prie\u0161 lankytojams i\u0161einant arba po to, kai jie slenka. Galite prid\u0117ti animacij\u0105, rodyti dalijimosi skai\u010dius arba bendr\u0105 dalijim\u0173 skai\u010di\u0173, kad sukurtum\u0117te socialin\u012f \u012frodym\u0105, ir nustatyti individualias spalvas, kad jos atitikt\u0173 j\u016bs\u0173 prek\u0117s \u017eenkl\u0105. Tai protingas b\u016bdas atkreipti lankytoj\u0173 d\u0117mes\u012f b\u016btent tada, kai jie yra labiausiai link\u0119 dalintis."
            ],
            "Simple Social Buttons Pro lets you create a custom Fly In box with your own title and message, choose its position and animation, and even display share counts or total shares to build social proof. You can fine-tune timing, icon spacing, and colors to match your brand, and control which post types it appears on. It's a great way to prompt visitors to share right when they're most engaged.": [
                "Simple Social Buttons Pro leid\u017eia jums sukurti individual\u0173 Fly In langel\u012f su savo pavadinimu ir \u017einute, pasirinkti jo pad\u0117t\u012f ir animacij\u0105, o taip pat rodyti dalijimosi skai\u010dius arba bendr\u0105 dalijim\u0173 skai\u010di\u0173, kad sukurtum\u0117te socialin\u012f \u012frodym\u0105. Galite tiksliai sureguliuoti laik\u0105, ikonos tarpus ir spalvas, kad jos atitikt\u0173 j\u016bs\u0173 prek\u0117s \u017eenkl\u0105, ir kontroliuoti, kuriuose \u012fra\u0161\u0173 tipuose jis pasirodo. Tai puikus b\u016bdas paskatinti lankytojus dalintis b\u016btent tada, kai jie yra labiausiai \u012fsitrauk\u0119."
